[0.000, "o", "\u001b[34m\u001b[47m 8\u001b[31m\u001b[47m♦\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m 7\u001b[30m\u001b[47m♠\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m 9\u001b[30m\u001b[47m♣\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m 8\u001b[30m\u001b[47m♣\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m K\u001b[31m\u001b[47m♥\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m Q\u001b[31m\u001b[47m♦\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m10\u001b[31m\u001b[47m♥\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m 8\u001b[30m\u001b[47m♠\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  \u001b[34m\u001b[47m K\u001b[30m\u001b[47m♣\u001b[17;11H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.000, "o", "   "]
[0.000, "o", "This 52-card solitaire starts with  the entire deck shuffled and dealt\u001b[18;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "out in four rows.  The aces are then moved to the left end of the layout,\u001b[19;11Hmaking 4 initial free spaces.  You may move to a space only the card that\u001b[20;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "matches the left neighbor in suit, and is one greater in rank.  Kings are\u001b[21;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces).\u001b[22;13HWhen no moves can be made,  cards still out of sequence are  reshuffled\u001b[23;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "and dealt face up after the ends of the partial sequences, leaving a card\u001b[24;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "space after each sequence, so that each row looks like a partial sequence\u001b[25;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "followed by a space, followed by enough cards to make a row of 14.\u001b[26;13H"]
[0.000, "o", "A moment's reflection will show that this game cannot take more than 13\u001b[27;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "deals. A good score is 1-3 deals, 4-7 is average, 8 or more is poor.\u001b[84G"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[8;69Hd\u001b[12d\b"]
[0.000, "o", "a\u001b[14;39H"]
[0.000, "o", "c    b\u001b[15;11H"]
